unty runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 51% of normal in July to August and 53% in August to September. Grid 25398 had its driest year in 1963 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
